# =================================================================
# ROOT ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION OVERVIEW
# =================================================================
# For Backend environment settings, see backend/.env.example
# For Frontend environment settings, see casino/.env.example
#
# QUICK START SUMMARY FOR DEPLOYMENT:
# Backend (Render):
#   - PORT (Auto-managed by Render)
#   - NODE_ENV=production
#   - DATABASE_URL (Supabase Pooled connection string)
#   - DIRECT_URL (Supabase Direct connection string)
#   - JWT_SECRET
#   - JWT_REFRESH_SECRET
#   - FRONTEND_URL=https://your-frontend.vercel.app
#
# Frontend (Vercel):
#   - VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
#   - VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
# =================================================================
